T1  - The proof is in the pudding: public beliefs, emotions and sentiments on drone deliveries in extreme contexts
AU  - Mahmoud, Ali B.
AU  - Mahroof, Kamran
JO  - European Journal of Marketing
VL  - 60
IS  - 9
SP  - 2193
EP  - 2229
PY  - 2026
