T1  - Independent risk factors for new ischemic brain lesions on diffusion-weighted imaging after carotid artery stenting: A retrospective study
AU  - Chen, Ruiling
AU  - Jiang, Bin
AU  - Zhu, Xianjin
AU  - Liu, Qi
AU  - Sun, Jinmei
AU  - Zhao, Yingying
