T1  - Fashion forecasting: an overview from material culture to industry
AU  - Garcia, Clarice Carvalho
JO  - Journal of Fashion Marketing and Management: An International Journal
VL  - 26
IS  - 3
SP  - 436
EP  - 451
PY  - 2021
DA  - 2021/07/23/
